oracle GNU Make 4.4.1
outcome success
file Makefile kept 4
| FOO = foo
| recurse = FOO is $$FOO and $(FOO)
| static := FOO is $(value FOO)
| all: ; @printf '[%s]\n' '$(recurse)' '$(value recurse)' '$(static)' '$(value static)' > out
file out touched 4
| [FOO is $FOO and foo]
| [FOO is $$FOO and $(FOO)]
| [FOO is foo]
| [FOO is foo]
